type: software
title: "Jev Social"
abstract: >-
  A read-only social research application where Jev selects bounded Instagram,
  TikTok, and LinkedIn operations, the local socai CLI executes them in the
  user's Chrome session, and the result preserves source-linked evidence and a
  cited report.
